    "No game runtime acceptance is claimed.",
    "E walk has real leg changes but uneven stride and paw-lift timing, most visible at transitions 3->4 and 7->0.",
    "N/S use simplified four-pose cycles; hind/front occlusion and high paw lifts can read as a slight march.",
    "S opposite-support poses were generated separately; small face/chest redraw and a slight size/shape change may show at 1->2 and 3->0.",
    "E run contains six distinct compressed/extended poses; the torso extension and bounce are somewhat exaggerated, not a rig-accurate trot.",
    "Groom edit repaired the tail; use only the supplied patch sourceRect to avoid replacing the other fifteen original sprites.",
    "Ground-anchor x coordinates are visually estimated anatomical registration points; y values use measured contact or an explicitly projected airborne baseline."
